QuestGuidance.Register("en",113,{
[3585]="70065EAE\n1\tDeliver dwarf-beards to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\030Collect dwarf-beards ([see journal]/7)\tCinaid directed you to collect dwarf-beards to use in creating a painful growth process for your sapling so that it will learn the scent of the dwarf and associate it with the pain of its adolescent growth.\n",
[3586]="70065EB3\n1\tSlaughter Leafcull bog-lurkers ([see journal]/10)\tCinaid suggested you go to Hithlad and destroy creatures of nature there. Slaughter potential would-be allies to your sapling.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tWith the lurkers defeated, you should return to Cinaid and tell them of your efforts.\n",
[3587]="70065EB2\n1\tKill Frostfell cave-claws ([see journal]/10)\tMake your way into the Isendeep Mine or Arador's End and decimate the cave-claws there.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tNow that the cave-claws are defeated, return to Cinaid at Gramsfoot.\n",
[3588]="70065E9C\n1\tKill nerbyg near Tol Ascarnen ([see journal]/10)\tMake your way to the waters surrounding Tol Ascarnen and kill the nerbyg present to ensure that their natural presence is diminished and cannot call to your sapling.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tNow that the nerbyg he wanted dead are removed, return to Cinaid at Gramsfoot and inform them of the news.\n",
[3589]="70065EB0\n1\tCollect legs of Man ([see journal]/7)\tCinaid asked you to collect legs of men to mash into the soil that feeds your sapling. Getting the taste for the blood of Men will defile the sapling.\n",
[3590]="70065EA9\n1\tSpeak with Gavran at Dâr-gazag\tMake your way to Dâr-gazag and speak with corruptor Gavran. Ask them about corrupting the sapling you discovered.\n2\tTalk to Cinaid\tReturn to Gramsfoot and find the Corruptor, Cinaid. They will tutor you in the best manner to despoil the sapling you found.\n",
[3591]="70065E9E\n1\tDeliver Elf-ears to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\030Collect Elf-ears ([see journal]/7)\tCinaid directed you to slaughter Elves in the Ettenmoors and carve off their ears so that the strips can be added to the soil that feeds your sapling.\n",
[3592]="70066677\n1\tFind and slaughter free-folk ([see journal]/15)\tCinaid wants you to make your way into the Ettenmoors and eliminate the Free Folk that wander there looking to assist the saplings. Slaughter them all!\n2\tTalk to Cinaid\tWith a good number of free-folk slain, you should return to Gramsfoot and inform Cinaid of your efforts.\n",
[3593]="70065EA1\n1\tCollect eagle feathers and deliver them to Cinaid at Gramsfoot ([see journal]/7)\tHead to the east, in the shadow of the mountain that houses the Isendeep Mine, and hunt the eagles there for their feathers.\n",
[3594]="70065E9A\n1\tCollect hobbit-feet ([see journal]/7)\tMake your way south to Hoarhallow and gather toes from the Little Folk there that you may feed the succulent flesh to your sapling.\n2\tDeliver the hobbit-feet to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tDeliver the delectable feet to Cinaid at Gramsfoot.\n",
[3595]="7004041A\n1\tDefeat the captors of the Gondorian hostages\tCorsair captors can be found in a home in Lothgobel. You should defeat the Corsair captors in Lothgobel.\n2\tDefeat Corsair kidnappers (total: 8)\tCorsair captors can be found in a home in Lothgobel. You should defeat the Corsair captors in Lothgobel.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Corsairs who kidnapped the townsfolk and held them captive in their home.\n",
[3596]="70040E0A\n1\tDefeat Corsairs at Hashadîr\tCorsairs can be found at Hashadîr in south-western Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs at Hashadîr.\n2\tDefeat Corsairs at Hashadîr (total: 10)\tCorsairs can be found at Hashadîr in south-western Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs at Hashadîr.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated numerous Corsairs at Hashadîr, lessening the threat to the shores of Gondor.\n",
[3597]="70040E83\n1\tDefeat Corsairs on their ships (total: 10)\tCorsairs can be found on the ships anchored off the beach of Hashadîr, in southern Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs on their ships.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated numerous Corsairs on their ships. The threat from the ships parked offshore from Hashadîr is lessened due to your valiant efforts.\n",
[3598]="70065AA2\n1\tBring the note to Irodon in Halach\tYou have found a Corsair note detailing Halach's guard rotations. You ought to bring this note to Irodon in Halach, which is south-west of the camp-site.\n",
[3599]="70040CF4\n1\tReclaim stolen Gondorian relics at Abedec's Watch\tGondorian relics can be found on Corsairs at Abedec's Watch in southern Belfalas. You should reclaim stolen relics from the Corsairs.\n2\tReclaim stolen Gondorian relics (total: 10)\tGondorian relics can be found on Corsairs at Abedec's Watch in southern Belfalas. You should reclaim stolen relics from the Corsairs.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have reclaimed several Gondorian relics from the Corsairs at Abedec's Watch.\n",
[3600]="70062BDE\n1\tCollect corrupted coltsfoot (total: 6)\030Collect corrupted feldwort (total: 6)\tCoruwen has asked you to travel to Cobshollow to the south of Lintrev to collect samples of corrupted plant life.\n2\tTalk to Coruwen\tCoruwen awaits your return with the plant samples in Lintrev\n3\tGrind the plants with the mortar and pestle\tCoruwen has asked you to grind the corrupted samples into a powder. Coruwen's mortar and pestle can be found nearby, next to her work table in Lintrev.\n4\tTalk to Coruwen\tCoruwen instructs you on how to mix the ingredients in the mixing bowl by her work table in Lintrev.\n5\tMix the ingredients in the bowl\tCoruwen has asked you to mix the samples in with the ingredients she has prepared. The mixing bowl can be found near Coruwen in Lintrev.\n6\tTalk to Coruwen\tThe cleansing draught seems to be complete. Bring it to Coruwen in Lintrev.\n7\tPour the cleansing draught\030Find a suitable area to pour the phial\tCoruwen has asked you to spread the cleansing draught along a running water source. She has suggested a waterfall to the south of Lintrev that runs into the Wadewater. The people of Stoor-vales often use this watering spot. You should look for their items.\n8\tTalk to Coruwen\tThe cleansing solution has been poured into a water source that runs into the Wadewater. This should help with the shadow's corruption for now. Coruwen can be found in Lintrev. You should tell her the deed is done.\n",
[3601]="70059772\n1\tDestroy supply crates at Cotfast\tSupply crates can be found at Cotfast in the Wildwood. You should destroy supply crates at Cotfast.\n2\tDestroy supply crates at Cotfast (total: 10)\tSupply crates can be found at Cotfast in the Wildwood. You should destroy supply crates at Cotfast.\n",
[3602]="70059769\n1\tDefeat foes at Cotfast\tFoes can be found at Cotfast in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Cotfast.\n2\tDefeat foes at Cotfast (total: 12)\tFoes can be found at Cotfast in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Cotfast.\n",
