[3613]="70024753\n1\tDeliver the albino skin to Areneth at Gath Forthnír in Angmar\030Collect albino skin (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver albino skin from the beasts near Gath Forthnír to Areneth at the hidden Ranger-camp.\n",
[3614]="70024756\n1\tDeliver the armoured carapaces to Areneth at Gath Forthnír in Angmar\030Collect armoured carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver armoured carapaces from the insects near Gath Forthnír to Areneth at the hidden Ranger-camp.\n",
[3615]="70024701\n1\tDeliver the broken great swords to Raith at Aughaire in Angmar\030Collect broken great swords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken great swords from the Orcs and Angmarim surrounding Aughaire to Raith, a Hillman within the settlement.\n",
